## Tool Call Sequence

When this parameter is used, follow this exact sequence:

```typescript
// 1. Read implementation progress and context files
read_file("[planning_folder_path]/implementation-progress.md", should_read_entire_file=true)
read_file("[planning_folder_path]/README.md", should_read_entire_file=true)
read_file("[planning_folder_path]/requirements.md", should_read_entire_file=true)

// 2. Read front-end-workflow enhancement implementation plan
read_file("[planning_folder_path]/implementation-front-end-workflow-enhancement.md", should_read_entire_file=true)
read_file("[planning_folder_path]/context-front-end-enhancement.md", should_read_entire_file=true)
read_file("[planning_folder_path]/context-front-end-patterns.md", should_read_entire_file=true)

// 3. Check if documentation verification exists
list_dir("[planning_folder_path]")
if (file_exists("[planning_folder_path]/documentation-verification.md")) {
  read_file("[planning_folder_path]/documentation-verification.md", should_read_entire_file=true)
}

// 4. Analyze current documentation state
read_file("1000xbrain/workflows/front-end-workflow/README.md", should_read_entire_file=true)
read_file("1000xbrain/workflows/front-end-workflow/[current_target_doc].md", should_read_entire_file=true)

// 5. Determine current implementation phase and state
// Based on implementation-progress.md and file state analysis

// 6. Report enhancement state and continuation plan
// "Front-end-workflow enhancement implementation is at phase X"
// "Continuing to Phase Y: [Phase Description]"
// "Documentation files to be enhanced: [list]"

// 7. Update implementation progress with continuation information
edit_file("[planning_folder_path]/implementation-progress.md",
          "Update implementation progress for continuation",
          "// ... existing content ...\n\n## Continuation Point\n- Date: [current date]\n- Continuing from: Phase X, Step Y\n- Reason: [continuation reason]\n\n// ... existing content ...")

// 8. Continue implementation based on determined state
// Either proceed to next phase or resume current phase
```

